# MC-X-F12 (writer 9): as L4_3_band_at_reads, day_band's table governing 2027..: charged's at reads a law-dated
# band at its reader's law date, so the ask line states law (L §4.3; LOAD-LAWDATE).
=== m.tally
model p
  tally 2
  on 2027-12-31
  start 2027-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source act "the act"
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input dom: int
input fee: money PLN
band day_band(a: int): int
def charged[m in months]: money PLN = fee at day_of(m, day_band(dom))
ask q: charged[2027-03]

version v_act
  cite act
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  day_band: [0, 15) = 10 "early"
  day_band: [15, 32) = 20 "late"

version v_f
  cite act
  governs 2027-01..2027-06
  known 2026-12-01
  dom = 3 governs always "dom"
  fee = 5.00 PLN "fee"
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LAWDATE ask q reaches charged, whose at reads law-dated facts at its reader's law date, without law (L §4.3) (m.tally:16)
